# Agent instructions

Always read `about-this-app.md` first — it is the single source of truth for LeadCatch SA.
On any architectural change (schema, routes, integrations, env vars, design tokens), update `about-this-app.md` and add an entry to `CHANGELOG.md` in the same change.
Never make this app talk to WhatsApp directly; use the external Operator via `src/lib/operator.server.ts`.
